AUDIO: 'giving it more tokens on high signal data and actual context, rather than just formatting. This AI lab investigated which data formats LLMs prefer to consume, and found that'

[01:42] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'markdown was the most token efficient while remaining highly accurate across multiple different providers. Let me quickly show you how it works using SerpApi\'s online playground, [music] and I\'ll leave a link to the playground in the description below. Doing a search'

